From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slothfulchat <patches@slothfulchat.invalid>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 12:59:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 87/92] web-app: DM composer suggests /bot commands from the
 contact's bio

Reuses the :emoji: completion menu's generic CompletionProvider
machinery (patch 0049) with a new trigger: typing `/` in a DM chat
opens the same menu, populated from any /commands the contact's bio
lists. Parsing reuses the existing botcommand linkify tokenizer
(the one that already turns /commands in messages and status text
into clickable chips), so word-boundary rules stay in one place.

CompletionItem gains an optional description field so a suggestion
row can show more than a glyph.
